# Wave 1 (v1 schema) only. Enumerated deliberately.
#
# `- queries: .` would sweep in References/Security/Observability/Testing, which
# still emit the legacy v0 3-column shape and which harness/run.sh excludes by
# name. Two disagreeing definitions of "the wave 1 set" is how a consumer ends up
# parsing a v0 row with a v1 decoder.
#
# Wave 2 adds the remaining four here in the same PR that migrates their schema.
- description: spring-signals wave 1 (v1 schema)
- query: ApiSurface.ql
- query: Configuration.ql
- query: ErrorHandling.ql
- query: HibernateTypes.ql
- query: JakartaMigration.ql
- query: Messaging.ql
- query: NativeSql.ql
- query: OpenApiSurface.ql
- query: OutboundClients.ql
- query: Persistence.ql
